Description: study tool for two-sided flash cards
 Flash Cards is a small GNOME/GTK application for creating decks of
 two-sided flash cards and quizzing yourself on them.
 .
 Each deck is a named collection of cards with a front and a back, stored
 as a plain JSON file so decks are easy to back up, sync or edit by hand.
 The self-test mode draws a random card from a deck and reveals the answer
 on demand.
